    {"tipo":"vf","enunciado":"Maximilian got angry at the guards.","correta":false,"explicacao":"He prayed even for those who did evil."},
    {"tipo":"multipla","enunciado":"What do we call someone who gives their life out of love for Jesus?","opcoes":["A martyr","An artist","A champion"],"correta":0,"explicacao":"Martyrs loved Jesus more than their own lives."},
    {"tipo":"vf","enunciado":"Jesus said there is no greater love than to give your life for your friends.","correta":true,"explicacao":"Maximilian did exactly that."},
    {"tipo":"multipla","enunciado":"What did Maximilian show the world?","opcoes":["That love is stronger than hatred","That anger solves everything","That everyone should think only of themselves"],"correta":0,"explicacao":"Love always wins in the end."},
    {"tipo":"vf","enunciado":"Today Saint Maximilian is in Heaven and prays for families.","correta":true,"explicacao":"We can ask him to protect our family."},
    {"tipo":"multipla","enunciado":"Which word goes with Saint Maximilian?","opcoes":["Self-giving","Selfishness","Fear"],"correta":0,"explicacao":"Self-giving means giving yourself out of love."}
